atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/5e25317027813134df3ff6affe445491.mp4?t=1782420492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/a6c3393d8e628027e05788ae527385e2.webp?t=1782420492\" width=582 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision lasers, homing missiles, plasma cannons—experiment to find your perfect combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/571a4d6585bbfa3f10cc7e53a7a6372c.poster.avif?t=1782420492\" width=596 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/571a4d6585bbfa3f10cc7e53a7a6372c.webm?t=1782420492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/571a4d6585bbfa3f10cc7e53a7a6372c.mp4?t=1782420492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/07e0ebfe3544b209c00c6a25add407ed.webp?t=1782420492\" width=582 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across war-torn planets, asteroid belts, and enemy capital ships, each with unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/2f15bc43cba79036f0e0a18c71237bc0.poster.avif?t=1782420492\" width=596 